{"id": "UgzxAa_FE2zPqrXuMn54AaABAg", "parent": null, "likes": 25, "text": "공기처럼 자연스럽게 스며드는 음악입니다. \n🎧 그냥 편하게 틀어두세요. \n  🎵Tracklist \n00:00 Raindrops in My Morning Espresso \n04:09 Bitter Morning Brew in April  \n09:04 The Empty Seat Across the Table  \n12:37 Last Sip of Our Shared Silence  \n16:10 Midnight Jazz in an Empty Booth  \n20:00 Bitter Steam in the Morning Light  \n23:55 Shadows Dancing on the Wet Pavement  \n28:07 Counting Raindrops in a Half Empty Cup  \n31:42 The Spring That Forgot Our Names  \n34:52 Tracing Memories in the Coffee Steam \n39:02 The Silent Rain That Washed Away April \n43:26 Two Spoons of Solitude \n46:55 Rainy Streets Seen from a Corner Booth \n50:33 A Distant Piano in the Foggy Morning \n54:31 Cold Porcelain and Fading Footsteps \n58:09 Watching the World Drip from the Eaves \n1:02:27 The Weight of Unspoken Words \n1:06:20 The Quietest Hour Before the First Light", "published": "2026-05-11T08:02:14", "replies": 0, "creator": true}
